									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						Gulzar Group of Institutes has given me an astonishing platform for the overall growth and development. The campus has excellent infrastructure and is very beautiful with perfect blend of nature and student-friendly amenities, such as gym, football and basketball courts, canteen, activity center and modern well-equipped library.
The teachers are very friendly, professional and inspiring. 
					</div>
					<cite class="elementor-testimonial__cite"><span class="elementor-testimonial__name">Simran Suleja</span><span class="elementor-testimonial__title">Now, Place in Ferrous</span></cite>				</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial__image">
						<img decoding="async" src="./slide1_files/0dummy.webp" alt="Simran Suleja">
											</div>
