		</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide swiper-slide-duplicate-active" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" data-swiper-slide-index="0" aria-label="1 / 4" style="width: 667px; margin-right: 25px;">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						Reviews are common. You’ll find them everywhere but the one you are reading right now is not a review. I, am writing my heart out. When I joined GGI, it was just a college, a place where I had to study. It was a new start of my life, far from home. I was anxious, of course, but that anxiousness never remained for long. I never realised that I was already become a member of a big family, a family that would always be there for me, for the next four years. 					</div>
					<cite class="elementor-testimonial__cite"><span class="elementor-testimonial__name">Moris Adam</span><span class="elementor-testimonial__title">Computer Science Engineering, 6th Semester</span></cite>				</div>
						<div class="elementor-testimonial__footer">
