							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						GGI was like my second home where I got the opportunities to explore myself in every part of it which helped me to know my weaknesses as well as my strength. The faculties in GGI are so professional that they help you in their respective subjects but also in helping the overall growth of the students.
					</div>
					<cite class="elementor-testimonial__cite"><span class="elementor-testimonial__name">Hari Krishna</span><span class="elementor-testimonial__title">Now, Developer at WeboMaze </span></cite>				</div>
